=product @PRODUCER@ @BASE@ LIGHTTPD @PCSIVERSION@ full
1 'PRODUCER
=prompt @PRODUCER@
1 'PRODUCT
=prompt lighttpd @VERSION@ for OpenVMS (vms-lighttpd)
1 'NOTICE
=prompt lighttpd is distributed under the revised BSD licence.
1 RELEASE_NOTES
=prompt Documentation is in [VMSLIGHTTPD.DOC]README.VMS under the installation directory.
1 POST_INSTALL
=prompt Post-installation tasks for lighttpd (vms-lighttpd)
    Once, as SYSTEM: create the service account, data directory and site
    settings (SYS$MANAGER:VMSLIGHTTPD$CONFIG.COM):
    $ @VMSLIGHTTPD$ROOT:[COM]VMSLIGHTTPD$CONFIGURE
    Start and stop:
    $ @VMSLIGHTTPD$ROOT:[COM]VMSLIGHTTPD$CONTROL START
    $ @VMSLIGHTTPD$ROOT:[COM]VMSLIGHTTPD$CONTROL STOP
    At boot, add to SYS$MANAGER:SYSTARTUP_VMS.COM (after TCP/IP and SSL3):
    $ @SYS$STARTUP:VMSLIGHTTPD$STARTUP.COM
    At shutdown, add to SYS$MANAGER:SYSHUTDWN.COM:
    $ @SYS$STARTUP:VMSLIGHTTPD$SHUTDOWN.COM

PRODUCT REMOVE LIGHTTPD stops the service, removes the installed image and
deassigns VMSLIGHTTPD$ROOT; the data directory, the account and the site
settings are kept.
